d":null,"children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"防止重放攻擊","position":{"start":{"line":28,"column":3,"offset":750},"end":{"line":28,"column":9,"offset":756}}}],"position":{"start":{"line":28,"column":3,"offset":750},"end":{"line":28,"column":9,"offset":756}}}],"position":{"start":{"line":28,"column":1,"offset":748},"end":{"line":28,"column":9,"offset":756}}},{"type":"listItem","spread":false,"checked":null,"children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"用戶體驗的考量","position":{"start":{"line":29,"column":3,"offset":760},"end":{"line":29,"column":10,"offset":767}}}],"position":{"start":{"line":29,"column":3,"offset":760},"end":{"line":29,"column":10,"offset":767}}}],"position":{"start":{"line":29,"column":1,"offset":758},"end":{"line":29,"column":10,"offset":767}}}],"position":{"start":{"line":26,"column":1,"offset":726},"end":{"line":29,"column":10,"offset":767}}},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"不要害怕嘗試和犯錯；這是我們在密碼學和安全領域學習和成長的方式！","position":{"start":{"line":31,"column":1,"offset":771},"end":{"line":31,"column":33,"offset":803}}}],"position":{"start":{"line":31,"column":1,"offset":771},"end":{"line":31,"column":33,"offset":803}}}],"position":{"start":{"line":1,"column":1,"offset":0},"end":{"line":32,"column":1,"offset":805}}},"raw":"import { ArticleSection } from \"../../../../components/ArticleSection/ArticleSection\";\r\n\r\n# 結論\r\n\r\n恭喜你！你已完成 Solana 上的 Secp256r1 課程。你現在對 Secp256r1 在 Solana 上的運作方式及其在現代身份驗證方法中的角色有了扎實的理解。\r\n\r\n<ArticleSection name=\"你所學到的內容\" id=\"what-you-learned\" level=\"h2\" />\r\n\r\n在這個課程中，你已掌握以下重要知識：\r\n- Secp256r1（NIST P-256）橢圓曲線加密的基本原理\r\n- Solana 如何通過其預編譯實現 Secp256r1 簽名驗證\r\n- Secp256r1 與現代身份驗證方法（如通行密鑰）的關係\r\n- 如何在你的程序中實現安全的簽名驗證\r\n- 使用 Secp256r1 公鑰與 PDA 的最佳實踐\r\n\r\n<ArticleSection name=\"下一步\" id=\"next-steps\" level=\"h2\" />\r\n\r\n你現在已準備好使用 Secp256r1 在 Solana 上構建安全的身份驗證系統！以下是一些建議的下一步：\r\n\r\n1. 嘗試在自己的程序中實現 Secp256r1 簽名驗證\r\n2. 探索[挑戰部分](/zh-HK/challenges)以進行實踐練習\r\n3. 考慮如何使用 Secp256r1 改善你的應用程式安全性\r\n4. 加入我們的社群，分享你的實現並獲取幫助\r\n\r\n請記住，雖然 Secp256r1 提供了加密基礎，但實現安全的身份驗證需要仔細考慮：\r\n- 正確的簽名驗證\r\n- 安全的密鑰管理\r\n- 防止重放攻擊\r\n- 用戶體驗的考量\r\n\r\n不要害怕嘗試和犯錯；這是我們在密碼學和安全領域學習和成長的方式！\r\n","highlightedCode":{}}